                <pb facs="1078" n="984" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg984"/>

                <head>No. 614.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Curry.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-03-11"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 11,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Bayard informs Mr. Curry that the Government of the United States accepts the
                    extension proposed by the Government of Spain of the duration of the agreement
                    of October 27 until June 30.</p>
            </div>
